== About me
I am a Ph.D. student in the Electrical Engineering department at Northeastern University, advised by Professor Taskin Padir. I am interested in optimization, control, and machine learning, currently with applications in autonomous driving and robotics. My current research is focused on algorithms for distributed control of platoons.

== Education
- Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - June 2024 (expected)
- M.S. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - Dec. 2021
- B.S. in Mechanical Engineering, University of Maryland, Aug. 2013 - Dec. 2017

